    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i just wasted 20 years of my life. everything i built, the company, the house, the whole thing... it's just gone. all that work and for what. i look back and there's nothing to show for it. just a massive hole where my life used to be. it feels like the game is rigged and i've already lost.",
